# Allowlist for scripts/check-domain-terms.sh
# Format: path-glob|term|reason
# Only the generic words stack, namespace and cluster may be listed (the script
# rejects anything else, empty reasons, malformed lines and catch-all globs).
# Real Kubernetes/Helm/Azure/etc. domain concepts must be removed from the
# template, not allowlisted. One entry per path-glob and term; name specific files.
# Entries are per file, not per line: when adding text to a listed file, make sure
# new uses of the term are generic too.

# "stack" in prose: "full stack", "technology stack", "stack trace", "Docker stack"
.github/agents/devops-engineer.md|stack|lines 36/131/132/138: "the stack comes up healthy", "full stack (dev/prod mode)" = docker compose stack, generic Docker usage
.github/agents/orchestrator.md|stack|line 37: "full-stack feature", generic English
.github/agents/qa-engineer.md|stack|lines 3/64/199/236: "full stack" / "full Docker stack", generic English
.github/copilot-instructions.md|stack|lines 5/65: "Full-stack app", "Full stack (Docker)", generic English
CLAUDE.md|stack|"full-stack application template", "Full stack (Docker)", the "Stack:" label of the frontend technology list; generic English
.github/instructions/security.instructions.md|stack|lines 24/52: "stack traces" (never leak them), generic debugging term
README.md|stack|lines 1/3/57: "Full-Stack Application Template", "full-stack web applications", "Full stack (recommended)"; generic English
WIKI.md|stack|line 5: "full-stack application template", generic English

# "Full Stack Application" is the template's own UI title; tests assert on it
frontend/index.html|stack|page title "Full Stack Application"
frontend/src/pages/Home/index.tsx|stack|heading "Welcome to the Full Stack Application" and "full-stack application built with"
frontend/src/pages/Home/__tests__/Home.test.tsx|stack|asserts on the Home heading text
frontend/src/components/Layout/index.tsx|stack|app bar title "Full Stack App" and footer "Full Stack Application"
frontend/src/components/Layout/__tests__/Layout.test.tsx|stack|asserts on the Layout title text
frontend/src/__tests__/App.test.tsx|stack|asserts on the app title and Home heading text
frontend/e2e/home.spec.ts|stack|e2e assertions on the Home heading text
frontend/e2e/items.spec.ts|stack|e2e assertions on the Home heading text
frontend/e2e/navigation.spec.ts|stack|e2e assertions on the Home heading and app bar title
frontend/e2e/websocket.spec.ts|stack|e2e assertions on the Home heading text
